{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_37_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_37","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，王正月，師次於郎，以俟陳人、蔡人。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_37_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_37","textTraditional":"次，止也。俟，待也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_37_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_37","textTraditional":"二、甲午，治兵。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_37_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_37","textTraditional":"出曰治兵，習戰也。入曰振旅，習戰也。治兵而陳蔡不至矣。兵事以嚴終，故曰善陳者不戰，此之謂也。善為國者不師，善師者不陳，善陳者不戰，善戰者不死，善死者不亡。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_37_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_37","textTraditional":"三、夏，師及齊師圍郕，郕降於齊師。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_37_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_37","textTraditional":"其曰降於齊師何？不使齊師加威於郕也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_37_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_37","textTraditional":"四、秋，師還。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_37_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_37","textTraditional":"還者，事未畢也，遁也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_37_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_37","textTraditional":"五、冬，十有一月，癸未，齊無知弒其君諸兒。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_37_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_37","textTraditional":"大夫弒其君，以國氏者，嫌也，弒而代之也。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}